      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n.faq-wrap{max-width:750px;margin:30px auto;font-family:inherit}\n.faq-title{text-align:center;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px}\n.faq-item{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.faq-item summary{padding:16px 18px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}\n.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.faq-item summary:after{content:\"+\";float:right;font-size:22px}\n.faq-item[open] summary:after{content:\"−\"}\n.faq-item p{padding:0 18px 16px;margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.5}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</div>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>What can this vacuum clean?</summary>\n    <p>It’s great for cleaning cars, keyboards, desks, sofas, drawers, crumbs, dust, and small messes.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>Is it cordless?</summary>\n    <p>Yes, it is cordless and portable, making it easy to use anywhere.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>How does the 3-in-1 design work?</summary>\n    <p>It includes vacuum attachments and can also flip into an air blower for dust and tight spaces.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>How do I charge it?</summary>\n    <p>You can charge it using the included USB charging cable.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>Is it good for car interiors?</summary>\n    <p>Yes, it’s perfect for cup holders, seats, dashboards, vents, and hard-to-reach spots.</p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
